OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791359295
OL,3,CManchester City's top sponsor
OL,4,Cconsiders legal action against Premier
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FManchester City's main sponsor has
OL,8,Fsaid it is looking into legal action
OL,9,Fagainst the Premier League over a
OL,10,Fdamning report into the club.
OL,12,FEtihad Airways said it "stood with the
OL,13,Fclub" and "categorically rejects any
OL,14,Ffindings" that implicate the airline.
OL,16,FAn independent commission found City
OL,17,Fguilty of artificially inflating their
OL,18,Frevenues by #900m through "sham"
OL,19,Fsponsorship contracts that were
OL,20,Fsecretly funded by the owners, the Abu
OL,21,FDhabi United Group.
OL,26,@zD@[OUzD@`O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791359295
OL,3,CManchester City's top sponsor
OL,4,Cconsiders legal action against Premier
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FWhile the report did not name the
OL,8,Fairline in the findings, the state-
OL,9,Fowned company said it creates
OL,10,F"damaging implications for Etihad".
OL,12,FThe airline became the club's main
OL,13,Fshirt sponsor in 2009, and two years
OL,14,Flater Manchester City announced a
OL,15,Fnaming rights deal worth #400m for the
OL,16,FEtihad Stadium which has since been
OL,17,Fextended.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791359295
OL,3,CManchester City's top sponsor
OL,4,Cconsiders legal action against Premier
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FIn a statement, Etihad Airways said:
OL,8,F"Etihad categorically rejects any
OL,9,Ffinding, conclusion or implication
OL,10,Fthat suggests the airline has ever
OL,11,Fbeen involved in improper commercial
OL,12,Farrangements.
OL,14,F"The Premier League's public
OL,15,Fcommunication of the commission's
OL,16,Ffindings, following a period of
OL,17,Fselective leaks and reporting, has
OL,18,Ffurther created damaging implications
OL,19,Ffor Etihad despite the airline not
OL,20,Fbeing named in the redacted published
OL,21,Ffindings."
OL,26,@pD@AOU}D@JO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791359295
OL,3,CManchester City's top sponsor
OL,4,Cconsiders legal action against Premier
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FThe sponsor also criticised the
OL,8,FPremier League for a lack of
OL,9,Fcommunication with Etihad Airlines. It
OL,10,Fsaid it was never approached by the
OL,11,Fcommission to "provide relevant
OL,12,Finformation".
OL,14,FIt said: "At no time did the Premier
OL,15,FLeague reach out to or engage with
OL,16,FEtihad in the process associated with
OL,17,Fthe commission's opinion.
OL,26,@vD@JOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791359295
OL,3,CManchester City's top sponsor
OL,4,Cconsiders legal action against Premier
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,F"Etihad was therefore never given the
OL,8,Fopportunity by the Premier League to
OL,9,Fbe represented, to provide relevant
OL,10,Finformation, or to ensure the accuracy
OL,11,Fand fairness of information relied
OL,12,Fupon in reaching conclusions that may
OL,13,Fnow be interpreted as reflecting
OL,14,Fadversely on the airline."
OL,16,FIt comes as the Prime Minister Andy
OL,17,FBurnham said he "would be really
OL,18,Fconcerned" if Manchester City's owners
OL,19,Fsell the club following the guilty
OL,20,Fverdicts.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
