PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791359295
OL,3,CManchester City's top sponsor
OL,4,Cconsiders legal action against Premier
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FThe former Mayor of Greater Manchester
OL,8,Fthanked City Football Group, the
OL,9,Fclub's holding company, for the money
OL,10,Fit had invested into Manchester and
OL,11,Fsaid he would not want them to stop
OL,12,Fowning the Premier League club.
OL,14,FHe said: "They've been such a huge
OL,15,Fpartner in the building of modern
OL,16,FManchester. Obviously, the building of
OL,17,FManchester City into the global force
OL,18,Fthat it is."
OL,26,@zD@LO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/10
