OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791359295
OL,3,CManchester City's top sponsor
OL,4,Cconsiders legal action against Premier
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FCity have already indicated their
OL,8,Fintention to appeal, describing the
OL,9,Fdecision as "unsafe", and drew support
OL,10,Ffrom former manager Pep Guardiola in
OL,11,Fan X post on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,13,FGuardiola, who won six Premier League
OL,14,Ftitles with City before leaving at the
OL,15,Fend of last season, issued a social
OL,16,Fmedia post via the Pep Team X account
OL,17,Fin solidarity with the club's bosses,
OL,18,Fplayers, coach and supporters.
OL,26,@qD@MOUqD@TO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791359295
OL,3,CManchester City's top sponsor
OL,4,Cconsiders legal action against Premier
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,F"I want every single @ManCity fan to
OL,8,Fknow I am here; more than ever. I am,
OL,9,Falways have been, always will, be
OL,10,Fbehind my club, my owner, my chairman,
OL,11,FFerran, the players, staff, Enzo and
OL,12,Fyou, our unique supporters," the post
OL,13,Fread.
OL,15,F"Let me be clear: we will get through
OL,16,Fthis together. I love you all."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@\O]wD@AOUxD@_O]
