PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791359295
OL,3,CManchester City's top sponsor
OL,4,Cconsiders legal action against Premier
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FThe club were found by the commission
OL,8,Fto have operated a "disguised funding
OL,9,Fscheme" whereby companies from Abu
OL,10,FDhabi paid a fraction of the sum
OL,11,Frecorded on the club's books, with the
OL,12,Fbalance settled by Abu Dhabi United
OL,13,FGroup (ADUG), the company through
OL,14,Fwhich Sheikh Mansour owns the club.
OL,16,FThat scheme was found to have inflated
OL,17,Frevenue by more than #830million
OL,18,Fbetween 2009-10 and 2017-18.
OL,26,@pD@TOUqD@GO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/10
