OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1791359295
OL,3,CManchester City's top sponsor
OL,4,Cconsiders legal action against Premier
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FThe same commission which has given
OL,8,Fits decision will now consider what
OL,9,Fsanctions should be imposed.
OL,11,FThese could include significant
OL,12,Fsporting punishments, such as a points
OL,13,Fdeduction, or even expulsion.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/10
